hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"969","(94) Nuzur ke baare mein jo warid hua us ka bab. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Hammam ibn Munabbih se, unhon ne kaha: Yeh woh hai jo Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Nazr Ibn Adam ko koi cheez nahin dilati jo Main ne us ke liye pehle se muqaddar na ki ho, lekin nazr us se ja milti hai jo Main ne us ke liye muqaddar ki hai, Main us ke zariye bakheel se maal nikalwata hun, woh Mujhe us par woh deta hai jo us ne pehle Mujhe nahin diya tha."
"970","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ya'ni Ibn Ulayyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran ibn Husayn Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Thaqif Banu Uqayl ke haleef thay, Thaqif ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahaba mein se do aadmiyon ko qaid kiya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sahaba ne Banu Uqayl ke ek aadmi ko qaid kiya aur us ke sath al-Adba ko pakad liya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us ke paas tashreef laye jabke woh bandish mein tha, to us ne kaha: Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad! To Aap us ke paas aaye aur farmaya: Tumhara kya muamla hai? Us ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe kyun pakda, aur hajiyon ke aage chalne wali ko kyun pakda? Us ne is baat ko bada samajhte hue kaha, Aap ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein tumhare haleefon Thaqif ke jurm ki wajah se pakda hai, phir Aap us se wapas tashreef le gaye, to us ne pukara: Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad! Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah raheem narm khu thay, to Aap us ki taraf laut aaye aur farmaya: Tumhara kya muamla hai? Us ne kaha: Beshak main Musalman hun, Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum yeh kehte jab tum apne muamle ke malik thay to tum poori kamyabi pa lete, phir Aap us se wapas tashreef le gaye, to us ne pukara: Ya Muhammad! Ya Muhammad! To Aap us ke paas aaye aur farmaya: Tumhara kya muamla hai? Us ne kaha: Beshak main bhooka hun mujhe khilao, aur pyasa hun mujhe pilao, Aap ne farmaya: Yehi tumhari hajat hai, unhon ne kaha: Phir us ka fidya un do aadmiyon ke badle mein diya gaya, aur Ansar ki ek aurat qaid hui aur al-Adba pakdi gayi, aurat bandish mein thi, aur log apne maweshiyon ko apne gharon ke samne charate thay, ek raat woh bandish se nikal bhagi aur unton ke paas aayi, jab woh kisi unt ke qareeb jati to woh badbadati to woh use chhod deti, hatta ke woh al-Adba tak pahunchi to us ne aawaz na nikali, woh ek tayyar untni thi, woh us ke pichhle hisse mein sawar hui, phir us ne use hanka to woh chal padi, unhein us ki khabar hui to unhon ne use talash kiya magar woh un se aage nikal gayi, unhon ne kaha: Aur us ne nazr mani thi ke agar Allah use nijat de to woh use zaroor zibah karegi, phir jab woh Madinah pahunchi to logon ne use dekha aur kaha: Al-Adba Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki untni hai, us ne kaha: Us ne nazr mani hai ke agar Allah use nijat de to woh use zaroor zibah karegi, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Subhan Allah us ne use kya bura badla diya: ke agar Allah use nijat de to woh use zibah karegi? Allah ki nafarmani mein koi wafa nahin, aur na us mein jo banda malik nahin."
"971","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne humein khabar di, (ha). Aur Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se, Talhah ibn Abd al-Malik se, al-Qasim se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki ita'at ki nazr mane to use chahiye ke Us ki ita'at kare aur jo Us ki nafarmani ki nazr mane to use chahiye ke Us ki nafarmani na kare."
"972","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Musa ibn A'yan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khattab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Karim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Nazr do qism ki hai, pas jo Allah ke liye ho to us ka kaffara poora karna hai, aur jo shaitan ke liye ho to us mein koi wafa nahin aur us par qasam ka kaffara hai."
"973","Hammad ibn al-Hasan ibn Anbasah al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammam se, Qatadah se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, Uqbah ibn Amir Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se apni behan ke baare mein sawal kiya jis ne Ka'bah tak paidal chalne ki nazar mani thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah tumhari behan ki nazar se be-niyaaz hai, use chahiye ke sawar ho aur badanah hadi kare; aur ise Khalid al-Hazza ne Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se riwayat kiya aur ‘aur badanah hadi kare’ ka zikr nahin kiya."
"974","Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne humein khabar di, Yahya - yani Ibn Ayyub - se, Yazid ibn Abi Habib se, Abu al-Khayr se, Uqbah ibn Amir Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke unki behan ne Bait tak paidal chalne ki nazar mani, to unhon ne unke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se fatwa poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh sawar ho; aur Abu al-Khayr Uqbah se laziman wabasta rehte the."
"975","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Musa ibn Isma'il ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) maujud the ke achanak ek shakhs dhoop mein khada tha, to Aap ne uske baare mein poocha, to logon ne kaha: Yeh Abu Isra'il hai, us ne nazar mani hai ke woh khada rahega aur baithega nahin, aur saaya hasil nahin karega, aur baat nahin karega aur roza rakhega, to Aap ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh baat kare, aur saaya hasil kare, aur baithe, aur apna roza poora kare."
"976","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid ne humein bataya, Thabit se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo apne do beton ke darmiyan sahara diye hue chal raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh kya hai? Logon ne kaha: Us ne Bait tak paidal chalne ki nazar mani hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah is shakhs ke apne aap ko azab dene se be-niyaaz hai; phir Aap ne use hukm diya to woh sawar ho gaya."
"977","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Sa'd se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne kaha: Meri walida faut ho gayin aur un par ek nazar thi, to main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya, to Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke main unki taraf se use poora karun."
"978","Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim al-Dawraqi aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya - aur Ibn Hashim ne unki nisbat zikr nahin ki - Ubaydullah ibn Umar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, Umar Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Main ne jahiliyyat mein nazar mani thi ke Masjid al-Haram mein ek raat i'tikaf karunga, to Aap ne un se farmaya: Apni nazar poori karo."
"979","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, al-Hakam aur Muslim al-Batin aur Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr aur Mujahid aur Ata se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Meri behan faut ho gayi hai aur us par lagatar do mahine ke roze hain, Aap ne farmaya: Batao agar tumhari behan par qarz hota to kya tum use ada kartin? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: To Allah ka haq zyada haqdar hai."
"980","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Musa ibn A'yan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn al-Harith se, Ubaydullah ibn Abi Ja'far se ke Muhammad ibn Ja'far ne un se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Aishah Raziallahu anha se (riwayat hai) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs faut ho jaye aur us par roze hon to uska wali uski taraf se roze rakhe."
"981","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa - yani Ibn Yunus - ne humein bataya, Shu'bah se, Ja'far ibn Iyas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se hadees bayan karte hue suna ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Meri behan ne hajj karne ki nazar mani thi aur woh faut ho gayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar us par qarz hota to kya tum use ada karte? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: To Allah ka (haq) ada karo, Woh wafa ka zyada haqdar hai."
"982","al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne humein bataya, Habib al-Mu'allim se, Ata se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se (riwayat hai) ke ek shakhs ne Bait al-Maqdis mein namaz padhne ki nazar mani, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Yahan namaz padho - yani Masjid al-Haram mein - Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul! Main ne Bait al-Maqdis mein namaz padhne ki nazar mani hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Yahan namaz padho."
